These are the datasets and the code used to train the LLM on recognizing existential emotions. This is still not a finished model, hence there is a script to merge my "manually split" data files into a new and better split as I made some mistakes.
The python file with the date (25-06-2026) is the actual code used to train the LLM. The output of training can be found in task-42.
In order to train the LLM, all packages must be installed. 
This script runs on Python version 3.12.0
